OL,3,GNEWSAPublic to have say on #600m fuel  
OL,4,Aplant plans                            
OL,6,FResidents and businesses are being     
OL,7,Finvited to have their say on plans for 
OL,8,Fa #600m fuel plant near Hull.          
OL,10,FLanzaTech wants to build the facility, 
OL,11,Fknown as DRAGON Humber, at Saltend     
OL,12,FChemicals Park, where it would produce 
OL,13,Fsustainable aviation fuel (SAF) and    
OL,14,Frenewable diesel.                      
OL,16,FThe company said the project would     
OL,17,Fcreate 50 permanent full-time jobs on  
OL,18,Fsite, alongside about 50 new employment
OL,19,Fopportunities in the supply chain.     
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
