OL,3,GNEWSAPublic to have say on #600m fuel  
OL,4,Aplant plans                            
OL,6,FThe public can comment on the proposals
OL,7,Fonline via the project website or at a 
OL,8,Fpublic event in Hedon Market on 9      
OL,9,FDecember between 09:00 and 13:00 GMT.  
